ion":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-06-23T10:57:41Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T08:26:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.7 stable, 4.7 rc1, rc2, rc3, beta 4 and beta 1. All broken.\nThe earliest version I can find this breaking is 4.7 dev 3.\n\nNot reproducible in 4.7 dev2, 4.7 dev1, 4.6.3 and earlier versions. It works fine there.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 63.15 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nemit_particle does not properly work on instantiated GPUParticles3D, it seems. I discovered this after upgrading and doing a bisect - it works fine if running on an existing node in the same scene, but not an instantiated GPUParticles3D for whatever reason.\n\n\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAll you need to do is press 'enter' on the keyboard to see this does not work on 4.7 when booting this project, but does on 4.6.3. Attached below is an MRP of the issue. Open it in 4.6.3 to see it work, 4.7 to see it not work.\n\n```extends Node3D\n@export var particle_test: PackedScene\n@onready var current_scene: Node3D = get_tree().current_scene\n\nfunc _input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n\tif event.is_action_pressed(\"ui_accept\"):\n\t\tvar particles: GPUParticles3D = particle_test.instantiate()\n\t\tcurrent_scene.add_child(particles)\n\t\tparticles.global_position = global_position\n\t\tvar t: Transform3D = Transform3D(Basis.IDENTITY)\n\t\tparticles.emit_particle(t, Vector3.ZERO, Color.WHITE, Color.WHITE, GPUParticles3D.EmitFlags.EMIT_FLAG_POSITION)\n```\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[emit-particle-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29247379/emit-particle-mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120574/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120574/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}